Package: scans
Title: Analyze AI Agent Trajectories
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Wade", , "github@jameshwade.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to import, inspect, scan, and validate
    trajectories produced by artificial intelligence agents built with
    'ellmer' and related R packages. Complements outcome evaluation with
    post-run analysis of messages, tool calls, events, and multi-agent
    execution.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://jameshwade.github.io/scans/,
    https://github.com/JamesHWade/scans
BugReports: https://github.com/JamesHWade/scans/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    cli (>= 3.6.3),
    rlang (>= 1.1.4),
    S7 (>= 0.2.2),
    tibble (>= 3.3.0)
Suggests:
    ellmer (>= 0.4.2),
    shinychat,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    vitals
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/testthat/parallel: true
Encoding: UTF-8
